  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: Parquet and Apache Arrow extended-CLR-domain round-trip (Half, DateOnly, TimeOnly, Guid, TimeSpan, nint/nuint, char, DateTimeOffset) via native field types plus nivara.clrType schema metadata, with Int128/UInt128 throwing documented UnsupportedTypeException; faithful ML.NET ToNivaraFrame reading every primitive DataView type (ConvertToFloat throws for non-numeric values instead of silently returning 0f); immutable JsonOptions/CsvOptions/ParquetWriteOptions with With() builders, CsvTrimOptions and ParquetCompression enums, ParquetWriter honoring Compression/RowGroupSize/WriteMetadata, and ParquetReader reading all row groups; canonical Json/Csv entry points (ReadFrame/ScanFrame/ScanQuery). Existing surface: Parquet read/write with compression, Apache Arrow bidirectional conversion, ML.NET DataView integration, CsvHelper-based CSV parsing, lazy data source infrastructure.",
